<%- include('../partials/head', { pageTitle, metaDescription, canonicalPath }) %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
  <div class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Shipping &amp; delivery</h1>
      <p class="lede mt-1">What it costs, how long it takes, and what happens if something goes wrong.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Charges — the full list</h2>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Charge</th><th scope="col">Amount</th><th scope="col">When it applies</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Standard shipping</td><td>₹79</td><td>Orders below ₹1,499</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Free shipping</td><td>₹0</td><td>Orders of ₹1,499 and above</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Cash on delivery fee</td><td>₹49</td><td>Only if COD is enabled and you choose it. Shown the moment you select it.</td></tr>
            <tr><td>GST</td><td>Included</td><td>18%, embedded in every listed price</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Packaging fee</td><td>None</td><td>We do not charge separately for packaging</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Platform / handling fee</td><td>None</td><td>We do not charge a platform fee</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2>Timelines</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> within 2 working days of payment confirmation.</li>
          <li><strong>Metro delivery:</strong> 2–4 working days after dispatch.</li>
          <li><strong>Other serviceable PIN codes:</strong> 4–7 working days after dispatch.</li>
          <li><strong>Remote or non-serviceable PIN codes:</strong> we will contact you before accepting the order rather than take payment and then cancel it.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small">
          These are the ranges we aim for based on courier performance. They are not guarantees, and if a delay is on
          us we will say so and tell you the new expectation.
        </p>

        <h2>Packaging</h2>
        <p>
          Pieces ship in a recycled board box with a cotton pouch and a care card. Nothing is in sealed branded
          plastic. If an order is a gift, say so in the delivery notes and we will leave the invoice out of the box
          and email it to you instead.
        </p>

        <h2>Delivery attempts and address changes</h2>
        <p>
          The courier attempts delivery up to three times. If a change of address is needed before dispatch, contact
          support with your order reference and we will update it. Once dispatched, the address cannot be changed —
          in that case we will help you arrange a return and re-order instead of leaving you stuck.
        </p>

        <h2>If your parcel does not arrive</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Check the tracking status if you were sent one.</li>
          <li>Contact support with your order reference within <strong>10 days</strong> of the expected delivery date.</li>
          <li>We open an investigation with the courier. If the parcel is confirmed lost, we replace or refund it —
            you are not asked to chase the courier yourself.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="small muted">
          Courier integration is not connected in this build, so tracking references are created manually by the
          support team. We do not display tracking numbers that do not exist.
        </p>

        <p><a href="/returns">Refund and return policy</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact support</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
<%- include('../partials/consent-banner') %>
</body>
</html>
